    <briefdescription>
<para>Adjust PSA configuration: enable always-on features. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is an internal header. Do not include it directly.</para><para>Always enable certain features which require a negligible amount of code to implement, to avoid some edge cases in the configuration combinatorics. </para>    </detaileddescription>
